      "content": "wait, delay the launch? look, the marketing team already spent a massive chunk of the quarterly budget on the Xylos hype campaign. if we delay, we lose that momentum and the skin sales might tank. look closer at the actual win-rate data for the top 1% of players—is he really that broken, or is it just a temporary spike because people are still learning the kit? be real with me, do we actually need a nerf or are we just being overly cautious?",
